---
// /admin/ — Sveltia CMS admin shell.
//
// Phase 6 prep, task #186: previously lived at public/admin/index.html, which
// served fine at build (Astro copies public/* into dist/*) but 404'd in dev
// because the Astro dev server doesn't auto-resolve `/admin/` to
// `/admin/index.html` for files in `public/`. Promoting the shell to an Astro
// route fixes the dev URL ergonomics and keeps the production output
// identical (dist/admin/index.html).
//
// The body is the same minimal bootstrap as before. Sveltia loads its own
// SPA shell from the unpkg-pinned script tag and reads
// `/admin/config.yml` (still in public/admin/config.yml).
//
// Sveltia v0.159.2 pinned 2026-05-16 — see public/admin/config.yml for sync
// notes and release link. Upgrades are a deliberate task; do not switch to
// @latest.
//
// Note: NO BaseLayout / Header / Footer chrome here on purpose — the Sveltia
// SPA owns the whole viewport.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
    <title>Aerial Edge CMS</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/@sveltia/cms@0.159.2/dist/sveltia-cms.js" is:inline></script>
  </body>
</html>
